<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sun earnings view upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sun earnings view upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said on Thursday it had raised its 1997 earnings-per-share (EPS) estimate for Sun Microsystems Inc to $1.75 from $1.67.</p>
<p>-- First Boston also raised its 1998 EPS estimate to $2.05 from $2 and kept the company's hold rating.</p>
<p>-- The computer maker's shares rose 2-1/2 to 30-3/4 in heavy trade on Thursday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
